<https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn%3Aoid%3A2.49.0.1.840.0.eed3ecee06902681eb3e65005f3297a13f666e80.001.1#info> <http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/emergency/cap/1.2/hasDescription> "THE NATIONAL WEATHER SERVICE HAS ISSUED SEVERE THUNDERSTORM WATCH\n452 IN EFFECT UNTIL 1 AM CDT SATURDAY FOR THE FOLLOWING AREAS\n\nIN KANSAS THIS WATCH INCLUDES 2 COUNTIES\n\nIN CENTRAL KANSAS\n\nLINCOLN               RUSSELL\n\nTHIS INCLUDES THE CITIES OF LINCOLN, RUSSELL, AND SYLVAN GROVE."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn%3Aoid%3A2.49.0.1.840.0.14ed9d519b6737e4c0515a4664c0abad34579c5d.001.1#geocode-042005> <https://api.weather.gov/ontology#hasFIPSCode> "042005"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
