<https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn%3Aoid%3A2.49.0.1.840.0.eed3ecee06902681eb3e65005f3297a13f666e80.001.1#area> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/emergency/cap/1.2/Area> .
<https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn%3Aoid%3A2.49.0.1.840.0.14ed9d519b6737e4c0515a4664c0abad34579c5d.001.1#info> <http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/emergency/cap/1.2/hasDescription> "SVRPBZ\n\nThe National Weather Service in Pittsburgh has issued a\n\n* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...\nSouthwestern Venango County in northwestern Pennsylvania...\nNorthwestern Armstrong County in west central Pennsylvania...\nNortheastern Butler County in west central Pennsylvania...\nSouthwestern Clarion County in west central Pennsylvania...\n\n* Until 845 PM EDT.\n\n* At 800 PM EDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 6 miles northeast\nof Slippery Rock, or 8 miles east of Grove City, moving east at 25\nmph.\n\nHAZARD...60 mph wind gusts.\n\nSOURCE...Radar indicated.\n\nIMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.\n\n* Locations impacted include...\nKnox, Rimersburg, Chicora, East Brady, Parker, Sligo, Worthington,\nEmlenton, Bruin, Clintonville, Shippenville, St. Petersburg, Eau\nClaire, Petrolia, Karns City, Callensburg, Barkeyville, Fairview,\nWest Sunbury and Foxburg."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn%3Aoid%3A2.49.0.1.840.0.14ed9d519b6737e4c0515a4664c0abad34579c5d.001.1> <http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/emergency/cap/1.2/hasCode> "IPAWSv1.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn%3Aoid%3A2.49.0.1.840.0.eed3ecee06902681eb3e65005f3297a13f666e80.001.1> <http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/emergency/cap/1.2/hasMessageType> <http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/emergency/cap/1.2/AlertMessage> .
